static const char __pyx_k_OpenAI_compatible_API_server_pl[] = "\nOpenAI-compatible API server platform adapter.\n\nExposes an HTTP server with endpoints:\n- POST /v1/chat/completions        \342\200\224 OpenAI Chat Completions format (stateless; opt-in session continuity via X-Hermes-Session-Id header)\n- POST /v1/responses               \342\200\224 OpenAI Responses API format (stateful via previous_response_id)\n- GET  /v1/responses/{response_id} \342\200\224 Retrieve a stored response\n- DELETE /v1/responses/{response_id} \342\200\224 Delete a stored response\n- GET  /v1/models                  \342\200\224 lists hermes-agent as an available model\n- POST /v1/runs                    \342\200\224 start a run, returns run_id immediately (202)\n- GET  /v1/runs/{run_id}/events    \342\200\224 SSE stream of structured lifecycle events\n- GET  /health                     \342\200\224 health check\n\nAny OpenAI-compatible frontend (Open WebUI, LobeChat, LibreChat,\nAnythingLLM, NextChat, ChatBox, etc.) can connect to hermes-agent\nthrough this adapter by pointing at http://localhost:8642/v1.\n\nRequires:\n- aiohttp (already available in the gateway)\n";
